<p>Any direct damage that exceeds <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">32%, 25%, 21%, 18%, 16%</acronym> of your maximum life has the excess damage converted to a shallow wound that bleeds over the next <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 5, 5</acronym> turns. This bleed cannot be resisted or removed, but can be reduced by Bloodstained. Extremely powerful hits (more than 40% of your max life) are not fully converted.</p><p></p><p><span style="font-style: italic"><span class="tstr-font-italic">You can't just die. That would be too easy.</span></span></p>